{"version":1,"key":"card:709","content":{"id":709,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f5076ac4-2b15-4413-848b-38625ac91091","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当一个企业或个人还不起钱的时候，债权人和债务人坐下来重新商量怎么还钱，这个过程就是债务重组。核心目的是避免直接走向破产清算，让双方都能少亏一点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fb8532fa-f332-4856-b9c9-a098ce122631","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么双方都愿意坐下来谈？对债务人（欠钱的人）来说，不重组可能直接倒闭，重组后可以获得缓冲时间，经营好转后再把债务还上，能活下来。对债权人（出借方）来说，不重组就只能等破产清算，可能一分钱都拿不到，重组后至少能收回一部分；另外如果对方是长期合作伙伴，重组可以助其度过难关，未来继续合作。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"16fbd413-911c-4ff8-8809-f2071df7e4fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常见的重组方式包括："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"af5a0a2d-b7cb-4da8-ab99-681d1d5f76ed","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5fc7e111-c427-489b-9f8c-be533c11652c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3a6742e5-a92d-42af-8bb0-ef67fd617086","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"延期偿还（展期）：本来今年还，改到三年后还"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7992db86-c7b3-483b-81f8-9f52ced91a9d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d65fb98f-4ca9-4268-a57c-b5be24c8e18a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"减免债务：比如本来欠 100 万，现在只要还 70 万就行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"68ca8c2e-6d8d-47ba-bbfe-658f1972578a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8ad3b023-8e61-4d73-8326-65c05918353e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"降低利率：比如利息从 10% 降到 3%"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b389a6a7-9348-42bd-8ecc-b4252d6f5709","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"41dca350-4d8b-41a4-aabc-4320af3406ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以资抵债：用存货、固定资产、房产等来抵扣欠款"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"74ae2360-e963-4f87-9b47-9683d455c502","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8cccd0b3-d960-4b14-a999-8a533171afb2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"债转股：把债权转换为股权，债权人变成股东，共享企业发展收益"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"860c9168-bb12-46b8-9f52-a2b5aab91f89","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实际情况下往往会组合上述手段，比如「减免 20% 本金 + 剩余部分延期 5 年 + 利率下调至 3% + 30% 债转股」。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b6e95cfd-9bfb-48f0-aac4-71574def6950","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"债务重组可以由债务人主动申请，也可以由债权人发起，还有法院主导的司法重组（如破产重整）。不同主导方式下，流程和约束力也不同。"}]}],"tags":["经济/债务重组","概念"],"createTime":1778818666564,"updateTime":1778820976481,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1778820976481}}